{"title": "Restoration", "pageid": 31811, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Restoration", "categories": ["Environmental objects"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\"> This article is about the static items found in Baldur's Gate 3. For the spells, see <a href=\"/wiki/Lesser_Restoration\" title=\"Lesser Restoration\">Lesser Restoration</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Greater_Restoration\" title=\"Greater Restoration\">Greater Restoration</a>. \n</div>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Restoration_Pod.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Restoration_Pod.png/300px-Restoration_Pod.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Restoration_Pod.png/450px-Restoration_Pod.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/52/Restoration_Pod.png/600px-Restoration_Pod.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"A large and friendly conch swooshes its neon blue tentacles through the air, expelling a pleasant healing mist.\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/52/Restoration_Pod.png/300px-Restoration_Pod.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"533\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/52/Restoration_Pod.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>A restoration device</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Restoration</b> is an entity found throughout <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. Appearing as biotechnology of <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illithid\">Illithid</a> origin with the appearance of a tentacled conch, or as a faucet, party members can interact with the mechanisms to fully replenish their resources. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>Using Restoration provides party members with the full benefits of a <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">long rest</a>. Restoration fully heals the party, restores all <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">spell slots</a>, replenishes class-specific resources such as <a href=\"/wiki/Bardic_Inspiration_(resource)\" title=\"Bardic Inspiration (resource)\">Bardic Inspiration</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_Divinity_Charge\" title=\"Channel Divinity Charge\">Channel Divinity Charges</a>, and recharges all actions including those granted by equipment. It does <i>not</i> end ongoing effects that are described as lasting until the next long rest, nor does it reset the number of <a href=\"/wiki/Short_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short Rest\">short rests</a> that can be taken before the next long rest.\n</p><p>In <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_Mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour Mode\">Honour Mode</a>, Restoration can only be used once before being exhausted, with the exception of the Restoration pod in the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">Mind Flayer Colony</a> and the Restoration Faucet in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> In all other difficulty settings, Restoration can be used an unlimited amount of times. In tactician and honour mode, fewer restoration locations are available. See notes below for details. In Custom difficulty these locations are controlled by the \"Additional Combat Mechanics\" setting.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Locations\">Locations</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_One\">Act One</span></h3>\n<ul><li>On the <a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid\" title=\"Nautiloid\">Nautiloid</a>, in the partially-destroyed room with the mind flayer emblem on the ground at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-37&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-372</span></li>\n<li>On the Nautiloid, in the room with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/38px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/50px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/25px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart's</a> pod at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-12&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-362</span></li>\n<li>On the Nautiloid, just outside of the door to the Helm at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;4&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-389</span></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Two\">Act Two</span></h3>\n<ul><li>In the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">Mind Flayer Colony</a>, next to the lift immediately preceding the fight against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ketheric Thorm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Portrait_Ketheric_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ketheric_Thorm\" title=\"Ketheric Thorm\">Ketheric Thorm</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;752&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-34</span></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Act_Three\">Act Three</span></h3>\n<ul><li>At the pool inside of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/38px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/50px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Raphael's\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael's</a> boudoir in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a> <sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>Next to the entrance to the courtyard in <a href=\"/wiki/High_Hall\" title=\"High Hall\">High Hall</a> <sup id=\"cite_ref-honourmode_3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-honourmode-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li>\n<li>Next to the brainstem in <a href=\"/wiki/High_Hall\" title=\"High Hall\">High Hall</a>, immediately preceding the final fight <a href=\"/wiki/Confront_the_Elder_Brain#Atop_the_Netherbrain\" title=\"Confront the Elder Brain\">Atop the Netherbrain</a> <sup id=\"cite_ref-honourmode_3-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-honourmode-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes_and_references\">Notes and references</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note::before{content:\"Notes\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}</style><div class=\"reflist refs-nogroup\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> The restoration pod in the <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Colony\" title=\"Mind Flayer Colony\">Mind Flayer Colony</a> and the restoration faucet in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a> both refresh after approximately 6 seconds. They also refresh on saving and reloading. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> This can be used an unlimited number of times while fighting Raphael until he is defeated. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-honourmode-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-honourmode_3-0\">3.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-honourmode_3-1\">3.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> This restoration pod is not available on tactician or honour mode. </span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714223424\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.039 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 986/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 6810/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1685/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 18/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2601/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 612014/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.457      1 -total\n 48.20%   14.680      3 Template:CharLink\n 39.98%   12.177      3 Template:Icon_link\n 38.53%   11.736      3 Template:Icon_text\n 37.11%   11.304      1 Template:Reflist\n 32.82%    9.996      6 Template:Trim\n 24.90%    7.585      3 Template:Ifempty\n  8.41%    2.561      4 Template:Ref\n  5.86%    1.784      3 Template:Icon\n  1.42%    0.432      4 Template:Coords\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31811-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714223424 and revision id 396003. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}